          "artifactId": "artifact_e03b4815-7716-456e-a3ad-3f4299f9acce",
          "summary": "Security review of order management system for e-commerce platform",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "security_review.md",
              "content": "# Security Review\n## Introduction\nThe order management system is a critical component of the e-commerce platform, responsible for processing and managing customer orders.\n## Security Requirements\n* Authentication and authorization for users and administrators\n* Data encryption for sensitive information\n* Access controls for orders and customer data\n* Regular security audits and vulnerability assessments\n* Incident response plan in place\n## Security Risks\n* Unauthorized access to orders and customer data\n* Data breaches due to lack of encryption\n* Insufficient access controls\n* Vulnerabilities in software and hardware components\n## Recommendations\n* Implement multi-factor authentication for users and administrators\n* Use end-to-end encryption for sensitive information\n* Conduct regular security audits and vulnerability assessments\n* Develop and implement an incident response plan"
            },
            {
              "path": "audit_log.py",
              "content": "import logging\n# Create a logger\nlogger = logging.getLogger('order_management_system')\n# Set the logging level\nlogger.setLevel(logging.INFO)\n# Create a file handler\nhandler = logging.FileHandler('audit_log.log')\n# Create a formatter and set the formatter for the handler\nformatter = logging.Formatter('%(asctime)s - %(name)s - %(levelname)s - %(message)s')\nhandler.setFormatter(formatter)\n# Add the handler to the logger\nlogger.addHandler(handler)\n# Log events\ndef log_event(event_type, event_data):\n    logger.info(f'{event_type}: {event_data}')"
            }
          ],
          "tests": [
            "Test authentication and authorization",
            "Test data encryption",
            "Test access controls",
            "Test security audits and vulnerability assessments",
            "Test incident response plan"
          ],
          "notes": [
            "The security review should be performed regularly to ensure the order management system remains secure",
            "The audit log should be monitored regularly to detect and respond to security incidents"
          ],
